<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #111827;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 16px;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 180px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .title {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .cta-wrapper {
            margin: 26px 0 20px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .support-box {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 20px 24px 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #111827;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">
                <img src="{{host}}/public/images/logo.png" alt="VapeHub Logo" class="logo" />
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h1 class="title">Forget something?</h1>
            <p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
            <p>Your order is still waiting at checkout. If you are ready, you can complete your purchase in a few clicks.</p>
            <p>We kept everything ready for you.</p>

            <div class="cta-wrapper">
                <a class="cta-button" href="{{ctaUrl}}">Complete Your Purchase</a>
            </div>

            <div class="support-box">
                Need help with checkout? Reply to this email and our customer service team will assist you.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div>Kind regards,<br />The Team @ <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">VapeHub.co.uk</a></div>
            <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
                Customer Services: <a href="mailto:customerservices@vapehub.co.uk">customerservices@vapehub.co.uk</a>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 6px;">&copy; {{currentYear}} VapeHub. All rights reserved.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
